# Build context hygiene — keep secrets, deps and bulky data out of the image.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

# Uploaded files & logs (runtime data, never baked in)
backend/uploads
backend/logs
logs

# Benchmark/fixture data (not needed to run the app)
backend/benchmarks/fixtures
backend/test

# Repo/VCS/docs noise
.git
.github
.freebuff
*.md
!README.md

# Local override files for docker-compose (if any)
docker-compose.override.yml
